Microsoft Learn's Conditional Access for

75
00:04:47.698 --> 00:04:50.154
workload identities page; the range,

76
00:04:50.154 --> 00:04:54.083
ring and decision rules are
the program's design guidance.

77
00:04:54.083 --> 00:04:58.411
Oh one: a policy that targets
users, groups, roles, a filter,

78
00:04:58.411 --> 00:05:04.057
or every service principal in the tenant,
instead of the ring's object I D's.

79
00:05:04.057 --> 00:05:06.746
Oh two: a managed identity in scope.

80
00:05:06.746 --> 00:05:10.945
Oh three: a principal that isn't a
