principal sign-ins.

227
00:14:34.343 --> 00:14:39.118
And you saw a ring enforced only with the
D N P five decision, the allow-enforce

228
00:14:39.118 --> 00:14:43.667
switch and the reviewed summary, and
held again when the summary changed.

229
00:14:43.667 --> 00:14:49.216
The evidence an ISSO keeps is the scope
file, the pre-merge check, the findings,

230
00:14:49.216 --> 00:14:53.972
the plan and its requests, the sign-in
summary with the hash the D N P

231
00:14:53.972 --> 00:14:59.256
five record cites, the alert definition,
and each run's manifest, all dated.

232
00:14:59.256 --> 00:15:02.330
Before you ship, work through
the chapter's checklist.

233
